studio's socket: its words are tmux's, for slots

studio listens on a socket: list, the slots and what runs in each; send,
keys or text into one; read, its nodes, not a scrape of its screen;
focus; and watch, a line for each thing that happens, a draw, the eye
moving, cur, as tmux -C streams its notifications. until it is there,
send and read are studio's verbs, which tmux carries out.
